  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup unsweetened shredded coconut",
    "1 large egg white",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1/2 teaspoon almond extract",
    "2 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "20 gram low-carb dark chocolate (such as Lily's)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F and spread a thin layer of shredded, unsweetened coconut onto a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Once preheated, place the coconut in the oven to toast up a bit (about 4–5 minutes). This step is optional, but it helps to bring out even more of the coconut flavor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/01Toasted.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, beat the egg whites until foamy and doubled in size.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/02Beat-egg-whites.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly add the erythritol and a pinch of salt while continuing to mix.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/03Add-eryth.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the almond extract for a twist on traditional coconut macaroons.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/04Add-extract.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the coconut flakes have toasted and cooled, add them to the mixture and fold everything together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/05Add-coconut.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a small ice cream scoop, tightly pack the batter into little balls and gently place them on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Bake for about 15 minutes or until golden.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/06Bake-until-golden.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the chocolate drizzle by melting the coconut oil and sugar-free chocolate on the stovetop, stirring continuously to prevent the chocolate from burning.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/07Melt-chocolate.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the macaroons from the oven and drizzle over the chocolate. If dunking the macaroons in the chocolate, make sure to let them cool completely before handling. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-covered-macaroons/#wprm-recipe-51879-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
